The climate of Petra seems to suit you really well, unless
your tan is due to the smoke of guns.

Our dear enemies are starting to find the joke in poor taste.
You must expect reprisals!

You will go to the island of LUARA. To the SOUTH is an island
held by the Communists and another island to the WEST held
by the Capitalists. You can guess the rest.

Admiral Torque will stay at PIRAN, he still has a small surprise
for you... You must see that your sea troops control
this sector, be careful enemy submarines proliferate there.

Let me know as soon as these two islands are under your
control.